// ───────────────────────────── live shift video for the store checklists (v18.57, owner 19 Nov 2026) ─────────────────────────────
// Before the morning or night list can be submitted, the staff record a video live from the app (camera only – no gallery upload)
// on that day, walking through the whole store and store areas to show the finished fixed tasks. The app stamps store, shift,
// date and running time onto the picture. Saved in Drive ("Store task videos folder ID"); managers play it when checking.
